## SQ-RE-31 | pressure chamber: 8 coal blocks per diamond (was 9), 4 per diamond shard
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest makes minecraft:diamond`; `/cdevtest bytype pneumaticcraft:pressure_chamber max=400`
@pass a `pneumaticcraft:pressure_chamber` recipe makes `minecraft:diamond*1` from 8 coal blocks (the ingredient shows `minecraft:coal_block`; the count is in `part=fields` or the JSON); the shard recipe from 4 is unchanged
@fails `crystal.js` `Item.of(i.coal_block, 8)`
> cdevtest makes minecraft:diamond
> cdevtest bytype pneumaticcraft:pressure_chamber max=400
expect verb=makes id=\S+ result=minecraft:diamond\*1 serializer=pneumaticcraft:pressure_chamber
look the coal block count of the diamond recipe is 8 (rdetail the id from the makes line; part=fields or the dumped JSON)

## SQ-RE-32 | single cinder flour Create filling: redstone, glowstone dust, gunpowder at 25 mB
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest rdetail cinder_redstone_filling`; `/cdevtest rdetail cinder_glowstone_filling`; `/cdevtest rdetail cinder_gunpowder_filling`
@pass three `create:filling` recipes, each one cinder flour -> 1 `minecraft:redstone` / `minecraft:glowstone_dust` / `minecraft:gunpowder`; the fluid (the potion) 25 mB as the other seven singles
@fails `dust.js` createFilling calls
> cdevtest rdetail cinder_redstone_filling
> cdevtest rdetail cinder_glowstone_filling
> cdevtest rdetail cinder_gunpowder_filling
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*cinder_redstone_filling serializer=create:filling result=minecraft:redstone\*1
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*cinder_glowstone_filling serializer=create:filling result=minecraft:glowstone_dust\*1
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*cinder_gunpowder_filling serializer=create:filling result=minecraft:gunpowder\*1
look each ingredients= starts with the cinder flour; part=fields (if printed) shows 25 mB

## SQ-RE-33 | thunder detector assembly: the filling step takes the regular mundane potion only
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest rdetail thunder_detector`
@pass the sequenced assembly's filling step fluid NBT has `Bottle:"REGULAR"` and `Potion:"minecraft:mundane"`; in game a splash mundane potion fluid does not advance it (RE-33)
@fails `redstone.js` filling NBT
> cdevtest rdetail thunder_detector
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*thunder_detector\S* .*part=step\d+ serializer=create:filling
look the filling step line names the mundane potion fluid; if the NBT is not printed, read the recipe JSON (/dumprecipes) for Bottle:"REGULAR"
